From: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 00:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: resolve AP forward path for hardware offload

Hardware flowtable route construction walks through a bridge to the
destination wireless interface using ndo_fill_forward_path.  mac80211
delegates the last step to the driver's net_fill_forward_path callback,
but ath12k does not provide one.  The complete path is consequently
discarded and netfilter falls back to the bridge device for both the
redirect action and ingress metadata.  PPE cannot allocate a virtual
port for such a rule.

Expose a Wi-Fi 7 AP interface as the terminal Ethernet device in the
forward path.  This only resolves the logical path; the flowtable driver
still decides whether it supports the wireless device and may reject the
rule normally.

Signed-off-by: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c
@@ -1112,6 +1112,23 @@ skip_peer_find:
 	}
 }
 
+static int
+ath12k_wifi7_net_fill_forward_path(struct ieee80211_hw *hw,
+				   struct ieee80211_vif *vif,
+				   struct ieee80211_sta *sta,
+				   struct net_device_path_ctx *ctx,
+				   struct net_device_path *path)
+{
+	if (vif->type != NL80211_IFTYPE_AP)
+		return -EOPNOTSUPP;
+
+	path->type = DEV_PATH_ETHERNET;
+	path->dev = ctx->dev;
+	ctx->dev = NULL;
+
+	return 0;
+}
+
 static const struct ieee80211_ops ath12k_ops_wifi7 = {
 	.tx				= ath12k_wifi7_mac_op_tx,
 	.wake_tx_queue			= ieee80211_handle_wake_tx_queue,
@@ -1157,6 +1174,7 @@ static const struct ieee80211_ops ath12k
 	.cancel_remain_on_channel       = ath12k_mac_op_cancel_remain_on_channel,
 	.change_sta_links               = ath12k_mac_op_change_sta_links,
 	.can_activate_links             = ath12k_mac_op_can_activate_links,
+	.net_fill_forward_path		= ath12k_wifi7_net_fill_forward_path,
 #ifdef CONFIG_PM
 	.suspend			= ath12k_wow_op_suspend,
 	.resume				= ath12k_wow_op_resume,
